  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a potential relationship between (+)-Iridodial lactol and FaDu through a series of target interactions involving Ataxin-2. This compound appears to act as a target for multiple compounds, including 5-Hydroxy-2-Methylchromone-7-O-Rutinoside, Ajugaciliatin E, and Erysimoside, all of which have FaDu as their target. The consistent involvement of Ataxin-2 as a common intermediate in these pathways indicates a possible mechanism where (+)-Iridodial lactol may influence FaDu through Ataxin-2. The evidence supports a pathway where (+)-Iridodial lactol could modulate the activity of these compounds, which in turn affect FaDu. The integration of these findings highlights a potential role for (+)-Iridodial lactol in interacting with FaDu via a network of targets, emphasizing the importance of Ataxin-2 in this relationship.",
